    <briefdescription>
<para>Adaptive pool sizing strategy based on utilization thresholds. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Scales up when the fraction of idle connections drops below <computeroutput>(1 - scale_up_threshold)</computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Scales down when idle connections have been idle longer than <computeroutput>min_idle_time</computeroutput> and the pool is above <computeroutput>min_count</computeroutput>. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
